silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_09_validation_leg_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'ValidationLegConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, SHACLPassReport_77: the W3C SHACL conforms=true validation report for VetRecord_77; produced by the Tartu Animal Clinic SHACL validator on 2026-05-18 against TartuClinicSHACLShapes; distinct from VetRecord_77 itself; also, ValidationArrow_SHACL: the typed arrow SHACLPassReport_77 -> MittensColimitApex; distinct from record_leg (VetRecord_77 -> MittensColimitApex); also, TartuClinicSHACLShapes: the SHACL shape graph defining the structural requirements for veterinary records at Tartu Animal Clinic; the validation authority that produced SHACLPassReport_77." .
